# Trivy ignore list for AkyraHub/php
#
# Format:
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN
#
# CRITICAL/HIGH findings that cannot currently be patched (upstream lag,
# code-path not used, etc.) must be listed here with a justification block
# above the CVE. Review the list at every release and remove entries whose
# upstream fix has landed or whose expiry has passed.
#
# Template:
#   # CVE-YYYY-XXXXX (HIGH) — <package>
#   # Justification: <why this is not exploitable in our context>
#   # Reviewed by: <name> on YYYY-MM-DD
#   # Expires: YYYY-MM-DD (re-evaluate then; remove if upstream patched)
#   CVE-YYYY-XXXXX
#
# No entries yet — to be populated as needed.